            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><img src=\"93226e2d-9548-4ada-9486-9a7129abf988\" visible-if=\"always\" /><p>Welcome! In this lesson, you’ll create your first program with JavaScript and see it come to life.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 151532,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Programming languages like JavaScript let you write programs that computers can run.</p><p>Click on the code snippet <code>console.log(\"Hello, World\");</code> to add it to the code editor. Then, click the button below to run the program.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, World&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"28\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, World\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>console.log(\"Hello, World\");</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 151533,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Programs often need to remember information. Variables make that possible.</p><p>Add the code snippet that stores <code>\"Virginia\"</code> in a variable called <code>firstName</code>. Then, click the button below.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" firstName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Virginia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>const firstName = \"Virginia\";</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 151534,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Now the program can use the <code>firstName</code> variable.</p><p>Add <code>firstName</code> to the incomplete line, then run the program.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" firstName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Virginia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello,&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", firstName);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Virginia&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Virginia\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>firstName</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 151535,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A program can run several instructions in order.</p><p>Use the code snippets to form <code>console.log(\"How are you?\");</code> in the code editor. Then, click the button below to see the result.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" firstName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Virginia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello,&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", firstName);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;How are you?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Virginia\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"How are you?\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>console.log</code> followed by <code>(</code> and then <code>\"How are you?\"</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
